stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading: Open terms
    Loading --> Loading: Valid page has more documents
    Loading --> Reviewing: Last document page and fact review resolve
    Loading --> Fallback: Document failure or capacity or repeated cursor
    Fallback --> Reviewing: Fact review resolves
    Loading --> Retired: Refresh terms again
    Retired --> Retired: Late response or rejection ignored
    Loading --> Disposed: Close terms
    Disposed --> Disposed: Late response or rejection ignored
    Loading --> SignedOut: Session expires
    SignedOut --> SignedOut: Late response or rejection ignored
    Disposed --> Loading: Open an independent terms mount
    Reviewing --> Loading: Refresh terms
    %% never Retired, Disposed or SignedOut schedules another page or changes the view
